	(text "ASSEMBLY / RF LAYOUT\n\n	Preserve the shown order and footprints of matching and filtering components. \n	Keep RF traces short, controlled at 50 Ω, and free of stubs.\n	Place bypass capacitors and RF chokes directly beside their associated device pins.\n	Use a continuous RF ground plane with dense ground-via stitching around PA, LNA, RF-switch and filter sections.\n	Follow the manufacturer reference layout for exposed pads, grounding and thermal vias.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 718.312 506.222 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
